{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Golf of America</strong> is not just a golfing game\u2014<strong>you <i>are</i> the ball</strong>. Feel the wind rush past as you soar through the air, navigating challenging courses with precision and finesse. Master your shots, adapt to dynamic environments, and chase the perfect stroke across a variety of handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want more? Unleash your creativity with the in-game level editor and build your own courses for endless replayability. Share them with others and push the limits of what a golf game can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Become the ball. Feel the breeze. Dominate the course.</strong><br>Welcome to <i>Golf of America</i>\u2014where every shot is personal.<br><br>Features:<br>1. Large single player levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Multiplayer leader-boards based on single-player experiences\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Wind affects your shots/swings.<br>4. Custom level editor to create infinite maps and infinite replayablity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839230?t=1751425742","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839230/12d52f15c7fffa0e33f8262feecbdf139de2784b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751425742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839230/ab7cf5212f956b8df725ad13b263fee2d4e185c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751425742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839230/ab7cf5212f956b8df725ad13b263fee2d4e185c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751425742","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Golf of America</strong> is not just a golfing game\u2014<strong>you <i>are</i> the ball</strong>. Feel the wind rush past as you soar through the air, navigating challenging courses with precision and finesse. Master your shots, adapt to dynamic environments, and chase the perfect stroke across a variety of handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want more? Unleash your creativity with the in-game level editor and build your own courses for endless replayability. Share them with others and push the limits of what a golf game can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Become the ball. Feel the breeze. Dominate the course.</strong><br>Welcome to <i>Golf of America</i>\u2014where every shot is personal.<br><br>Features:<br>1. Large single player levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Multiplayer leader-boards based on single-player experiences\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Wind affects your shots/swings.<br>4. Custom level editor to create infinite maps and infinite replayablity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Tegridy Made Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839230/066a11c37a2944b593ab2dc83c58cad73e080979/header.jpg?t=1751425742","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Do not distribute without consent from owner.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Golf Of America","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3rd Gen / AMD Ryzen 3 1300x<br></li><li><strong>Memory